<mxCell id="b33" value="&lt;i&gt;θ&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;, v&lt;/i&gt; (true)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1102" y="389" width="127" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b34" value="• The controller reads the measured bus by name and returns &lt;i&gt;T&lt;sub&gt;a,cmd&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/i&gt;; the Actuator, not the controller, applies the limit &lt;i&gt;T&lt;sub&gt;a,max&lt;/sub&gt;(v)&lt;/i&gt;." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="529" width="1380" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b35" value="• PI and PID compute &lt;i&gt;T&lt;sub&gt;d,ref&lt;/sub&gt;(v,a&lt;sub&gt;y&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;e&lt;sub&gt;T&lt;/sub&gt;=T&lt;sub&gt;s&lt;/sub&gt;-T&lt;sub&gt;d,ref&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/i&gt; from the measured signals; the assist map reads &lt;i&gt;T&lt;sub&gt;s&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;v&lt;/i&gt; only." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="553" width="1380" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b36" value="• The dashed Delay and Gain blocks serve only the stability-margin test (defaults: no delay, gain 1)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="577" width="1380" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="b37" value="• The friction coefficient &lt;i&gt;μ&lt;/i&gt; is not measured: it acts on the tires as a disturbance." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="601" width="1380" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>